00:05:49.992 --> 00:05:51.839
<v Host>It means competition.

00:05:52.439 --> 00:06:04.031
<v Slow>新しい軽のEVの登場で、日本でEVの普及が進むかどうか、注目が集まっています。

00:06:04.831 --> 00:06:11.384
<v Host>With this new kei EV, all eyes are on whether electric cars will finally spread across Japan.

00:06:11.983 --> 00:06:14.192
<v Vocab>普及

00:06:14.591 --> 00:06:18.000
<v Host>It means spreading widely, or becoming common.

